  "note": "Inside the 山门 (front_yard.c, door.c, road1/2.c, drug_field.c, temple.c from outside, inner_yard.c, corridor.c, corridor1.c, tower.c): the training ground ringed with white poplars, the pile of bricks on its north side; the gate hall under gilt tiles, its jade plaque, the great door shut and the side doors open; the flagstone road between peonies to the golden 大雄宝殿 (four gilt dragons on its corners, gold bells under its eaves); the small stone path east to the herb garden laid out bed by bed; the garden west of the hall with its brook, little bridge, rockery and pavilion, 流云轩 north of it; the laurel walk to the 后殿; the walkway along the painted walls to the 香积厨; the two pagodas of the 塔林. Rich (修整得金碧辉煌) but old and used: the paving worn, the gilt dulled, the walls stained.",
